# Regression cases found by differential fuzzing and the external corpora (PLAN Q7): minimised
# programs on the fuzz metamodel (crates/qvto-testkit/fuzz/fuzz.ecore), run like the Eclipse
# cases (`qvto conform --suite fuzz`; fixture: `qvto conform record --suite fuzz`).

case fuzz_types
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir crates/qvto-testkit/fuzz/types
qvto types.qvto
in model.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note oclIsKindOf/oclIsTypeOf/oclAsType of Integer, Long, Real values (EDataType.isInstance); invalid tuple parts; invalid collection elements
end

case fuzz_typematrix
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir crates/qvto-testkit/fuzz/types
qvto typematrix.qvto
in model.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note oclIsTypeOf/oclIsKindOf of 22 kinds of values against 20 types
end

case fuzz_numconv
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir crates/qvto-testkit/fuzz/numconv
qvto numconv.qvto
in numconv.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note numbers stored in module properties and intermediate class features are converted to the declared type
end

case fuzz_inherit_ip_a
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir crates/qvto-testkit/fuzz/inherit_ip
qvto a.qvto
in a.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note the mapping body is the current instruction while inherited mappings run
end

